# =====================================================================
# Release V073 -- Drop stale passthrough Gold views (unblocks the model)
# =====================================================================
# ROOT CAUSE of "the numbers won't move": Gold.vw_Fact_Treatment_Plans (and
# vw_Fact_Invoice_Items) were hardcoded 1-1 passthrough views frozen at an old
# column set. They supersede the table in Meta.usp_Create_Gold_Views, so
# PBI.[_Treatment Plans] lost Course_Status / Private_Treatment_Value_Outstanding
# etc. -> the model's _Treatment Plans table failed to load -> every plan measure
# errored -> the semantic-model refresh failed -> the report stayed on stale data.
#
# These two views carry NO logic (pure column passthrough), so removing them and
# letting the generator build the PBI views from the Fact tables (sys.columns) is
# identical at the PBI layer -- but complete and self-maintaining. The logic-bearing
# views (vw_Dim_Invoices, vw_Fact_Payments, vw_Fact_Appointment_Journey) are untouched.
#
# The migration drops the two views + regenerates the PBI views. After deploy, refresh
# the semantic model 'DM Dentally' -- the failed measures resolve and everything updates.
#
# Run: .\Scripts\Deploy.ps1 -Manifest Releases\V073__drop_passthrough_fact_views.manifest -SkipTests
# =====================================================================

MIGRATE  Migrations\V073__drop_passthrough_fact_views.sql

TEST
